  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Historical dataset of Zoning in Seattle, Washington (State) as of 2026. Note: This map is not an official zoning map. For precise zoning information, please call or visit the Seattle Municipal Tower, Seattle Department of Construction and Inspections A polygon feature class showing current City of Seattle land use zoning areas. It provides information on the type of zoning, overlay districts, enacting ordinance numbers and effective dates. Zoning Code governs the use and development of land in Seattle. Zoning districts specify a category of uses (e.g., single-family residential, multifamily residential, commercial, industrial, etc.) including specific overlays and are applied by ordinance. Symbolized on the value DETAIL_DESC (group 26 categories)."
